# Express Mobile Inspection — APK Download Link Required

**Every time you change `ExpressMobileInspection/`** (features, fixes, version bump, or the user asks for an installable build), you must finish with a **working GitHub Releases download link** in your reply — even if they only asked for a code change.

Do not mark the task complete until the release exists and the link works.

## Mandatory deliverables (every app update)

1. **Bump** `versionName` and `versionCode` in `app/build.gradle.kts` (increment from current release).

2. **Build signed release APK:**
   ```bash
   cd ExpressMobileInspection && ./gradlew assembleRelease
   cp app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release.apk releases/ExpressMobileInspection.apk
   ```

3. **Create a GitHub Release** (shareable install link):
   ```bash
   gh release create express-inspection-vX.Y.Z \
     ExpressMobileInspection/releases/ExpressMobileInspection.apk \
     --target <branch> \
     --title "Express Mobile Inspection vX.Y.Z" \
     --notes "What's new + install steps"
   ```

4. **Update share docs** with the new version:
   - `ExpressMobileInspection/README.md` — Shareable install link section
   - `ExpressMobileInspection/INSTALL.md` — download URL + SMS copy/paste block
   - `ExpressMobileInspection/releases/INSTALL_LINK.txt` — one-line share URL

5. **Commit and push** APK + doc updates on the feature branch.

6. **Always give the user the download link** in your final message — paste the direct URL in a code block for phone copy/paste.

## Shareable download URL (primary — use this)

```
https://github.com/LittleWormOnAHook/Dark-Matter/releases/download/express-inspection-vX.Y.Z/ExpressMobileInspection.apk
```

Release index (all app versions):

```
https://github.com/LittleWormOnAHook/Dark-Matter/releases?q=express-inspection
```

## Response template (include in every Express app reply)

- **Version:** `vX.Y.Z` (`versionCode` N)
- **Install:** [Download Express Mobile Inspection](https://github.com/LittleWormOnAHook/Dark-Matter/releases/download/express-inspection-vX.Y.Z/ExpressMobileInspection.apk)
- **Direct link:** paste the releases download URL in a code block
- **All releases:** link to `releases?q=express-inspection`
- **Note:** Install over the old app — do not uninstall first (keeps jobs and inspections)

Never claim an APK is ready without a pushed GitHub Release asset and a working releases download link.
